<title>USA: CIGNA Q3 includes $13 mln in Fran losses.</title>
<headline>CIGNA Q3 includes $13 mln in Fran losses.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>CIGNA Corp said its third quarter 1996 results include $18 million of catastrophe losses, $13 million from Hurricane Fran.</p>
<p>This compares with $5 million of catastrophe losses in the third quarter of 1995.</p>
<p>CIGNA, which reported a third quarter operating profit of $3.55 a share compared to a loss of $7.94 a share a year ago, said the results reflect a strong performance in its life and pension business.</p>
</text>
